21-deny-anonymous-sid-read.update and 21-selfservice-bindrule.update.

Fixes: CVE-2026-76578
Signed-off-by: Alexander Bokovoy <abokovoy@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit f7e9ebf2ca2d193775402ce6a0605e8f49d1cde8)
